| Instance Name | Resource | Clock Region | Clock Source | Reference Clock | Feedback Mode | Feedback Clock | Clkout0 | Clkout1 | Clkout2 |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+---------+---------+---------+
|   pll_inst1   | PLL_TL0  |      T       |     core     |       clk       |    internal   |                | pll_clk |         |         |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+---------+---------+---------+

Instance Name                 : pll_inst1
Resource                      : PLL_TL0
Locked Pin Name               : pll_clk_lock
Clock Source                  : core
Reference Clock               : clk
Feedback Mode                 : internal

Reference Clock Frequency     : 32.0000 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 31.2500 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 48
Pre-Divider (N)               : 1
VCO Frequency                 : 1536.0000 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 2
PLL Frequency                 : 768.0000 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : pll_clk
Output Divider                : 6
Output Phase Shift            : 0
Output Frequency              : 128.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 7.812 ns

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * (M/N)
	    = 32.0000 MHz * (48/1)
	    = 1536.0000 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 1536.0000 MHz / 2
	    = 768.0000 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 768.0000 MHz / 6
	        = 128.0000 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 7.812 -name pll_clk [get_ports {pll_clk}]

---------- PLL Usage Summary (end) ----------

